{"type":"message","id":"5cc6877f","parentId":"46fdcb3e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T05:46:38.881Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants the math tutor skill to: analyze wrong answers and summarize problem-solving methods. Let me continue with the interview questions.","thinkingSignature":"616712c4931929bebe495f9931bf922723754c2f0eb6ac49b3c3ec76fb92bdfe"},{"type":"text","text":"明白！帮兮兮**分析错因 + 总结解题方法** 📖\n\n**问题2：** 你平时会怎么跟她说来触发这个skill？（想想自然表达，比如\"这道题讲讲\"\"帮我看看哪里错了\"）\n\n**问题3：** 有没有哪些情况**不应该**触发它？（比如：不要用来直接给答案、不要在考试时用）\n\n**问题4：** 做到什么程度算完成？列出3-5个可以打勾的检验标准。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":128,"cacheRead":53011,"cacheWrite":2862,"totalTokens":56135,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.0001536,"cacheRead":0.0031806599999999997,"cacheWrite":0.00107325,"total":0.00444771}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775108790523,"responseId":"061d35b6adc061904ed7eaa0e52f610b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"04952933","parentId":"5cc6877f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T05:49:04.538Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-02 13:49:03 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53d47a2414a8c3368a575889e60]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53d47a2414a8c3368a575889e60\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-02 13:49 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n问题2：讲讲这道数学题；问题3：不要直接给答案，要用引导思考的方式，逐步给出；问题4：有错因分析、有引导的问题系列、完成错题图片归档"}],"timestamp":1775108944534}}
{"type":"message","id":"ab2ed722","parentId":"04952933","timestamp":"2026-04-02T05:49:18.449Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I have answers for the first round. Let me summarize and confirm before moving to the second round.\n\nSummary so far:\n1. Goal: 分析错因，总结解题方法\n2. Trigger phrase: \"讲讲这道数学题\"\n3. Do not use: 不要直接给答案，要用引导思考的方式\n4. Done criteria:\n   - 有错因分析\n   - 有引导的问题系列\n   - 完成错题图片归档\n\nNow I need to move to Round 2: 运行环境","thinkingSignature":"97e00e3bd0e05f40b830395b5234c90c4063ce3b5b300411e468fb3ba1cc8f66"},{"type":"text","text":"**第一轮摘要确认**\n\n| # | 内容 |\n|---|------|\n| **产出** | 分析错因 + 总结解题方法 |\n| **触发语** | \"讲讲这道数学题\" |\n| **排除条件** | 不要直接给答案，要用引导思考、逐步提示的方式 |\n| **完成标准** | ✅ 有错因分析 ✅ 有引导问题系列 ✅ 错题图片归档 |\n\n---\n\n**【第二轮：运行环境】**\n\n**问题5：** 这个skill运行在什么环境里？（选项：OpenClaw / Claude Code / Cursor / 其他）\n\n**问题6：** 允许用哪些工具？（比如：读题目的图片工具、查文档库的工具、写文件的工具）\n\n**问题7：** 需要读取哪些参考资料？（比如：兮兮的错题本存档、已积累的专题文档）\n\n**问题8：** 需要写脚本吗？（比如：自动归档图片到指定文件夹）"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":295,"cacheRead":55716,"cacheWrite":558,"totalTokens":56703,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.000354,"cacheRead":0.00334296,"cacheWrite":0.00020925000000000002,"total":0.00394641}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775108944536,"responseId":"061d3651026d0b77bb84f6de08e2f420"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0cc219fb","parentId":"ab2ed722","timestamp":"2026-04-02T05:52:48.534Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-02 13:52:47 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53d40c255d3cc315f2d6024841c]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53d40c255d3cc315f2d6024841c\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-02 13:52 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n问题5：openclaw；问题6：允许使用读题目的图片工具、查文档库的工具、写文件的工具，以及你需要的工具，后续可以申请或提示我安装；问题7：需要读取兮兮的错题本存档、已积累的专题文档、以及我传给你要求你学习形成知识的文档；问题8：需要写必要的脚本，看你工作过程中的需要"}],"timestamp":1775109168529}}
