{"type":"message","id":"f8d3f89a","parentId":"5fe895f3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:05:28.475Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the user wants to proceed to round 3. Let me ask the output-related questions.","thinkingSignature":"9f6886f306f726e495bc1f4cdaaf6aed319881e5e1062ec96560081b4d7b515d"},{"type":"text","text":"**【第三轮：输出契约】**\n\n**问题9：** 最终输出必须长什么样？\n（比如：先给引导问题系列、再给完整解答思路、最后归档到飞书错题本）\n\n**问题10：** 有哪些**必须包含**的内容？\n（比如：必须先问思路、必须分析错因、必须给出引导问题）\n\n**问题11：** 有哪些**必须避免**的内容？\n（比如：避免直接给答案、避免跳过引导直接讲方法）\n\n**问题12：** 能给一个正例和一个反例吗？\n（正例：一次好的辅导是什么样的；反例：一次不好的辅导是什么样的）"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":151,"cacheRead":57340,"cacheWrite":3655,"totalTokens":61280,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.00018119999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0034403999999999997,"cacheWrite":0.001370625,"total":0.005032425}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775109914786,"responseId":"061d3a1bd55e1e23249f064b37750c71"}}
