{"type":"message","id":"433fe5cd","parentId":"b5b20a85","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:27:22.962Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The geography-tutor folder only has SKILL.md. But wait - the SKILL.md I read earlier was quite long (many years of 中考地理真题 data). Where is all that content stored? Let me re-read the SKILL.md to see if those 真题 sections are actually in the SKILL.md or somewhere else.\n\nActually looking at the SKILL.md content I read, it has sections for:\n- 2024年成都中考地理真题知识库\n- 2023年成都中考地理真题知识库\n- 2022年成都中考地理真题知识库\n- 2021年成都中考地理真题知识库\n\n\n- 2020年成都中考地理真题\n- 2019年成都中考地理真题\n- 2018年成都中考地理真题\n- 2017年成都中考地理真题\n- 2016年成都中考地理真题（参考）\n- 成都中考地理高频热点汇总（终极版）\n\nAll of this is stored directly in SKILL.md itself, which is making the file quite lengthy. I should reorganize this by moving the 中考真题 data out to separate reference files and creating supporting documents like quick-methods and good-examples to keep SKILL.md more focused.\n\nMy plan is to extract all those exam years into individual reference files, keep a summary in the main SKILL.md, then add good-example and bad-example files plus an updated SKILL.md with the standard structure. I'll also need to set up a references folder to store everything properly.","thinkingSignature":"6e41bf00d12383b92fbf7e13eda9f3a847805600397919aa385d443c15a4a9ae"},{"type":"text","text":"现有的真题数据都在SKILL.md一个文件里，有点太长。我来拆分成标准格式：知识库移到 `references/`，SKILL.md 保持核心流程结构。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zsoxfi1b4nt1_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/geography-tutor/{references,examples,scripts,assets}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":37769,"output":394,"cacheRead":37504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75667,"cost":{"input":0.011330699999999999,"output":0.0004728,"cacheRead":0.0022502399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014053739999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":177511122970