{"type":"message","id":"cbca9109","parentId":"cbd62ee6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:31:14.323Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! The zip is done. Now let me provide a summary to the user.","thinkingSignature":"22980f5c4ff97d3ca99971df9895cd7dd05d7d748ca38f4794217d181bfab1b2"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 优化完成！\n\n**主要改动：**\n\n| 改动项 | 原来 | 现在 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| 触发条件 | 弥散（各种说法都行） | 明确触发词 + 排除条件 |\n| 交互流程 | 内容多但偏\"老师讲\" | ✅ 引导提问 → 思路 → 解答 → 归档 |\n| 引导环节 | 无 | ✅ 先问卡点（图文对照/区域定位） |\n| 正反例 | 无 | ✅ good + bad examples各一篇 |\n| 完成标准 | 无 | ✅ 可打勾的 definition of done |\n| 输出格式 | 无 | ✅ 标准模板 |\n| 错题归档 | 无 | ✅ 归档至飞书错题本（学科=地理） |\n| 真题知识库 | 全塞在SKILL.md里 | 拆出 9 个 reference 文件，SKILL.md保持精简 |\n\n---\n\n## 文件包清单\n\n```\nskills/geography-tutor/\n├── SKILL.md                      ✅ 核心流程文件（精简后）\n├── references/\n│   ├── exam-2024.md              ✅\n│   ├── exam-2023.md              ✅\n│   ├── exam-2022.md              ✅\n│   ├── exam-2021.md              ✅\n│   ├── exam-2020.md              ✅\n│   ├── exam-2019.md              ✅\n│   ├── exam-2018.md              ✅\n│   ├── exam-older.md             ✅（热点汇总+薄弱点）\n│   ├── core-framework.md         ✅（五大主题+区域结构）\n│   └── quick-methods.md          ✅（读图步骤+答题模板）\n├── examples/\n│   ├── good-example.md           ✅\n│   └── bad-example.md            ✅\n├── scripts/                      （空）\n└── assets/                        （空）\n```\n\n**打包文件**：`/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/geography-tutor.zip`\n\n---\n\n这样两个skill格式就统一了，之后兮兮发数学题或地理题给我，我都会按\"问卡点→引导→思路→归档\"的流程来 🍎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":48466,"output":460,"cacheRead":37504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86430,"cost":{"input":0.014539799999999999,"output":0.000552,"cacheRead":0.0022502399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01734204}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775111461541,"responseId":"061d40253ed5d154823acbd695281f83"}}
