{"type":"message","id":"fe6c550e","parentId":"76d34ae7","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:40:51.231Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All three skills have been optimized. Let me now provide a summary of what was done for the biology tutor skill.","thinkingSignature":"0e95b15fad4647b17c7cc8f32d3471e9bf6b11b2ad3f3f69c4e11420e86e5efd"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 生物导师 Skill 优化完成！✅\n\n**主要改动（和地理同理）：**\n\n| 改动项 | 原来 | 现在 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| 触发条件 | 弥散 | ✅ 明确触发词 + 排除条件 |\n| 交互流程 | 偏\"老师讲\" | ✅ 引导提问 → 思路 → 解答 → 归档 |\n| 引导环节 | 无 | ✅ 先问卡点（原理理解/读图/实验设计） |\n| 正反例 | 无 | ✅ good + bad examples各一篇 |\n| 完成标准 | 无 | ✅ 可打勾的 definition of done |\n| 输出格式 | 无 | ✅ 标准模板 |\n| 错题归档 | 无 | ✅ 归档至飞书错题本（学科=生物） |\n| 知识库 | 全塞SKILL.md | 拆出4个reference文件 |\n\n---\n\n## 文件包清单\n\n```\nskills/biology-tutor/\n├── SKILL.md                      ✅ 核心流程文件\n├── references/\n│   ├── core-framework.md         ✅ 七大主题+核心概念\n│   ├── exam-analysis.md          ✅ 十年真题高频考点\n│   ├── weak-points.md            ✅ 兮兮薄弱点+改进建议\n│   └── quick-methods.md           ✅ 易错辨析+实验套路\n├── examples/\n│   ├── good-example.md           ✅\n│   └── bad-example.md            ✅\n├── scripts/                      （空）\n└── assets/                       （空）\n```\n\n**打包文件**：`/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/biology-tutor.zip`\n\n---\n\n**三科skill全部优化完毕：**\n- ✅ math-tutor（数学）\n- ✅ geography-tutor（地理）\n- ✅ biology-tutor（生物）\n\n格式统一，流程一致，兮兮发哪科题目来都按这个标准流程走 🍎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":60081,"output":415,"cacheRead":37504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98000,"cost":{"input":0.0180243,"output":0.000498,"cacheRead":0.0022502399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02077254}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775112038898,"responseId":"061d42679b969843e3b1a0006e6fcb0c"}}
