{"type":"message","id":"f425db48","parentId":"c8192b2c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:44:49.435Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! Now I have all the info I need. Let me optimize the yuwen-tutor skill. Key differences:\n- Chinese is about \"理解+表达\" not methods like math\n- The guided questions should focus on reading comprehension and expression\n- The structure should still be: trigger conditions, guided questioning, output format, file archiving, good/bad examples, definition of done\n\nI need to read the existing yuwen-tutor skill to understand the content, then restructure it to match the math/geography/biology format while keeping the Chinese-specific elements.\n\nLet me start optimizing. I won't do a full interview since the user has confirmed all 4 questions. I'll go ahead and restructure the skill.","thinkingSignature":"5aa1350fa899eb6dc61ff6c65e4f212d4efe130d403b5fe4e662958c224df733"},{"type":"text","text":"\n明白了！语文的\"理解+表达\"和理科的\"方法+计算\"是两种不同的辅导逻辑，都要保留。开始优化！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_16szm5lz2lnq_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/yuwen-tutor/{references,examples,scripts,assets}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":222,"cacheRead":97871,"cacheWrite":1332,"totalTokens":99559,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.00026639999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00587226,"cacheWrite":0.0004995,"total":0.0066783599999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775112278424,"responseId":"061d43577ecd302884802f6be0a87405"}}
