{"type":"message","id":"8ff17e50","parentId":"8947e37c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:47:13.110Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All four skills have been optimized. Let me now provide a summary to the user.","thinkingSignature":"e31c6dbcedb43d584fcdb341aa3ca3224717b254821af38e8f5bb59e92d5197c"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 语文导师 Skill 优化完成！✅\n\n**主要改动（和前三科一致）：**\n\n| 改动项 | 原来 | 现在 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| 触发条件 | 无 | ✅ 明确触发词 + 排除条件 |\n| 交互流程 | 内容多但偏\"老师讲\" | ✅ 引导提问 → 方法 → 解答 → 归档 |\n| 引导环节 | 无 | ✅ 先让她\"说\"（语文核心：理解在先） |\n| 辅导重点 | 无明确区分 | ✅ 语文=理解+表达，区别于理科的方法+计算 |\n| 正反例 | 无 | ✅ good + bad examples各一篇 |\n| 完成标准 | 无 | ✅ 可打勾的 definition of done |\n| 输出格式 | 无 | ✅ 标准模板 |\n| 错题归档 | 有提及 | ✅ 完善归档至飞书错题本（学科=语文） |\n| 知识库 | 全塞SKILL.md | 拆出4个reference文件 |\n\n---\n\n## 文件包清单\n\n```\nskills/yuwen-tutor/\n├── SKILL.md                      ✅ 核心流程文件\n├── references/\n│   ├── reading-methods.md       ✅ 阅读方法体系\n│   ├── writing-guidance.md       ✅ 文言文/古诗词体系\n│   ├── composition.md            ✅ 作文写作指导\n│   └── basics.md                 ✅ 基础知识（病句/成语）\n├── examples/\n│   ├── good-example.md           ✅\n│   └── bad-example.md            ✅\n├── scripts/                      （空）\n└── assets/                       （空）\n```\n\n**打包文件**：`/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/yuwen-tutor.zip`\n\n---\n\n**四科skill全部优化完毕：**\n- ✅ math-tutor（数学）\n- ✅ geography-tutor（地理）\n- ✅ biology-tutor（生物）\n- ✅ yuwen-tutor（语文）\n\n统一格式：触发词 → 引导提问 → 思路/方法 → 归档，全部对齐 🍎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":68084,"output":443,"cacheRead":37504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106031,"cost":{"input":0.020425199999999998,"output":0.0005316,"cacheRead":0.0022502399999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.023207039999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775112423006,"responseId":"061d43e77ec291a790caa2675caa452f"}}
